    <comment>Update to 4.2.0: opt-in omit_expired to skip expired rows on read, delta-channel write collection fix. Built and verified on aarch64: 151/156 tests passed per flavour, rpmlint 0 errors / 0 warnings / 0 badness, source_validator clean.</comment>
